   "subject": "Re: 有一段肌電信號，如何使用R軟體寫程式計算中值頻率和中位頻率，根據公式。",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Guke,<div><br></div><div>參考以下內容:</div><div><br></div><div>1. biosignalEMG套件可應用於EMG分析, 內容包括積分之計算.</div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/package=biosignalEMG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/package%3DbiosignalEMG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZekHbxlR5MqtPcDnMWBub\">https://cran.r-project.org/package=biosignalEMG</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>2. R內建 integrate 函數可用於積分計算.</div><div><br></div><div>3. 如果須撰寫程式進行積分計算, 可採用以下方法:</div><div><br></div><div><div>數值積分-梯形法則</div><div>數值積分-辛浦森法則</div><div><a href=\"http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/docu3/0991cal/calculus_ch07.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/docu3/0991cal/calculus_ch07.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw010wJInbEgvI3ChIruepxi\">http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/docu3/0991cal/calculus_ch07.pdf</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>4. Excel 梯形法則-範例參考:</div><div><a href=\"http://www.myengineeringworld.net/2013/06/integration-in-excel-trapezoidal-rule.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.myengineeringworld.net/2013/06/integration-in-excel-trapezoidal-rule.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KfE3Fo_-YJ7ZsTBPOGE3v\">http://www.myengineeringworld.net/2013/06/integration-in-excel-trapezoidal-rule.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>5. 執行參考結果</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tg3HiMTZMAg/WZW6mwO_fSI/AAAAAAAAL3g/RLEd-fMsFT8trXQ-h2lVtoP0h5DZBrUjwCLcBGAs/s1600/biosignalEMG.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tg3HiMTZMAg/WZW6mwO_fSI/AAAAAAAAL3g/RLEd-fMsFT8trXQ-h2lVtoP0h5DZBrUjwCLcBGAs/s1600/biosignalEMG.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3df6n07OBPOEdm_kbjSDmo\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tg3HiMTZMAg/WZW6mwO_fSI/AAAAAAAAL3g/RLEd-fMsFT8trXQ-h2lVtoP0h5DZBrUjwCLcBGAs/s320/biosignalEMG.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>6. R code</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 肌電信號EMG</div><div># date: 2017.8.17</div><div><br></div><div>library(biosignalEMG)</div><div><br></div><div>integrate(dnorm, -1.96, 1.96) # 0.9500042</div><div>integrate(dnorm, -Inf, Inf) # 1</div><div><br></div><div>x &lt;- read.table(&quot;emgsignal.csv&quot;, header=TRUE, sep=&quot;,&quot;)</div><div>str(x)</div><div>op &lt;- par(mfrow = c(2, 2))</div><div><br></div><div># plot1</div><div>plot(x$Ch1, type=&quot;l&quot;, main=&quot;graphics package&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># plot2</div><div>emg &lt;- as.emg(x$Ch1, samplingrate=1000, units=&quot;mV&quot;) # need to verify?</div><div>plot(emg, main=&quot;biosignalEMG package&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># plot3</div><div>emgr &lt;- rectification(emg, rtype = &quot;fullwave&quot;)</div><div>emgi &lt;- integration(emgr, reset = FALSE)</div><div>plot(emgi, main = &quot;Integrated EMG (no reset)&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># plot4</div><div>emgma &lt;- envelope(emgr, method = &quot;MA&quot;, wsize = 60)</div><div>plot(emg, main = &quot;MA-envelope&quot;)</div><div>plot(emgma, add = TRUE, lwd = 4, col = &quot;red&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>par(op)</div><div><br></div><div>?integration # integration of an EMG</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br><br></div>guke su於 2017年8月16日星期三 UTC+8上午9時46分17秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\">中值頻率：</span><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BS5uIa8RCgk/WZOjm4LdNbI/AAAAAAAAABI/pahPujLVDZ4nevkTvvkgE3G5WpWkubolACLcBGAs/s1600/2345%25E6%2588%25AA%25E5%259B%25BE.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BS5uIa8RCgk/WZOjm4LdNbI/AAAAAAAAABI/pahPujLVDZ4nevkTvvkgE3G5WpWkubolACLcBGAs/s1600/2345%2525E6%252588%2525AA%2525E5%25259B%2525BE.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CHCXzx7YHZlfUUAihQpEr\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BS5uIa8RCgk/WZOjm4LdNbI/AAAAAAAAABI/pahPujLVDZ4nevkTvvkgE3G5WpWkubolACLcBGAs/s320/2345%25E6%2588%25AA%25E5%259B%25BE.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"48\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sMG0SOCi1KE/WZOjH6b7lxI/AAAAAAAAABE/Lf36LVWxrTwXvZGkVbex9iFKr5UaHeKyQCLcBGAs/s1600/83025aafa40f4bfb5e57e6ed034f78f0f6361887.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sMG0SOCi1KE/WZOjH6b7lxI/AAAAAAAAABE/Lf36LVWxrTwXvZGkVbex9iFKr5UaHeKyQCLcBGAs/s1600/83025aafa40f4bfb5e57e6ed034f78f0f6361887.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237602162000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02M9a_rk5ElNW6lRQgrx85\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sMG0SOCi1KE/WZOjH6b7lxI/AAAAAAAAABE/Lf36LVWxrTwXvZGkVbex9iFKr5UaHeKyQCLcBGAs/s320/83025aafa40f4bfb5e57e6ed034f78f0f6361887.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"304\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">謝謝大家</p><br></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
